[ICD]
UID: ICD-4
TITLE: LowState (G1 → gearsonic)
COMM_TYPE: DDS Topic
SOURCE: G1
TARGET: gearsonic
TOPIC: rt/lowstate
MSG_TYPE: unitree_hg/LowState (raw DDS)
QOS: BestEffort
FREQUENCY: source-rate (~500 Hz)
STATEMENT: >>>
``motors[29]`` {``q``, ``dq``, ``tau_est``} + pelvis IMU(quat / gyro / accel) + ``tick`` + ``mode_machine``.
CRC32 검증.
<<<
PRECONDITION: G1 전원 · DDS 활성
COMMENT: >>>
소비처 4곳 — gearsonic(제어) · gearsonic ``MotorHealthMonitor`` (fault word · 케이싱/권선 온도 · 토크 정합 감시,
**로그 전용, E-STOP 발효 없음**; gearsonic ``b899bb7`` ``975c3d5``) · vla-inference(정책 관측, 직접 구독) ·
safety-controller(로봇 생존 감시).
<<<
